# Both presses of the double tap before the lock-on (I twice, the second while the first is still
# buffered, down + right held as it locks on): it locks on in the variant, an FS Salad Grind, not a
# Feeble. (The direction counts as it locks on, as for every grind.)
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 1.1 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
hold down 150..180
hold right 150..180
tap grind 158
tap grind 162
bot balance
run 300
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Salad Grind} within 160..175
expect no event grindStart{trick=FS Feeble Grind}
